{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"05baf10ca4c21d5deb934df66b24e8a985dcb4e41f4ec49eb3ea5f0860f319f9","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MmpK6uMh3tojC2cgEUH8Wa","type":"tool_result","content":"332\t2026-10-13\tchore(bench): bump PyJWT in the memory benchmark lockfile\n314\t2026-10-13\tci(windows): print per-assignment progress and heartbeat from shard runner\n253\t2026-10-13\tdocs(readme): setup before benchmarks, example where it is promised\n298\t2026-10-13\tfix(gitutil): stop multi-pattern git grep hang; kill git children on SIGINT/SIGTERM\n301\t2026-10-13\tfix(search): agent output no longer depends on measured latency\n296\t2026-10-13\tfix(search): cap implicit auxiliary results at top-k\n282\t2026-10-13\tfix(search): enforce agent byte budgets on session replay\n295\t2026-10-13\tfix(search): preserve source and primary identity under tight budgets\n281\t2026-10-13\tfix(sem): exclude untracked nested worktrees from the corpus\n280\t2026-10-13\tfix(sem): stop claiming ambiguous local calls are exact\n288\t2026-10-13\tfix(verify): a mentioned runner is not an invoked runner\n275\t2026-10-13\tperf(agentsetup): guide asks for --format agent, ~2.9x cheaper per query\n289\t2026-10-13\tperf(query): adaptive agent budget (draft; rank 2–5 evidence loss under review)\n311\t2026-10-13\tperf(sem): scan annotation windows without splitting the whole file\n310\t2026-10-13\tperf(sem): stop copying same-name candidates on every lookup\n313\t2026-10-13\tperf(sem): stream cache writes and verify preindex by digest, not decode\n264\t2026-10-14\tfeat(sem): label every relation EXTRACTED, INFERRED or AMBIGUOUS\n276\t2026-10-14\tfix(search): surface complete-symbol to agents, and stop abbreviating it\n270\t2026-10-14\tfix(sem): nested callables are emitted as phantom type members in Swift, Kotlin, Rust and PHP\n285\t2026-10-15\tbench(locate): enforce offline measurement and replay guards\n286\t2026-10-15\tci: