{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"7b5162277c021993d541cd39b99554f39b4036d4ad7b4dd86369d729d12b58a9","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ERNcBJUwDNCQq15AxxMeZV","type":"tool_result","content":"                    description: Frozen compare-snapshot merge-base SHA (hex)\n                    type: string\n                mergedAt:\n                    description: RFC3339 instant the change proposal merged; also transitions the trail to status=merged to keep merged_at and status consistent\n                    type: string\n            type: object\n        TrailCreateRequestBody:\n            additionalProperties: false\n            properties:\n                assignees: {}\n                base: {}\n                body: {}\n                branch_action: {}\n                branch_name: {}\n                priority: {}\n                ready_for_review: {}\n                status: {}\n                title: {}\n                type: {}\n            type: object\n        TrailCreateRequestJSON:\n            additionalProperties: false\n            properties:\n                $schema:\n                    description: A URL to the JSON Schema for this object.\n                    examples:\n                        - /api/v1/schemas/TrailCreateRequestJSON.json\n                    format: uri\n                    readOnly: true\n                    type: string\n                assignees:\n                    items:\n                        oneOf:\n                            - description: \"An actor reference: ulid:<account id> or @username. A bare string is a GitHub login (legacy).\"\n                              type: string\n                            - properties:\n                                actor_account_id:\n                                    description: An Entire account ULID.\n                                    type: string\n                              required:\n                                - actor_account_id\n                              type: object\n                    type: array\n                base:\n                    minLength: 1\n                    type: string\n                body:\n                    description: Markdown source, at most 100000 bytes.\n                    type: string\n                branch_action:\n                    enum:\n                        - create\n                        - link\n                    type: string\n                branch_name:\n                    type: string\n                priority:\n                    enum:\n                        - urgent\n                        - high\n                        - medium\n                        - low\n                        - none\n                    type: string\n                ready_for_review:\n                    type: boolean\n                status:\n                    enum:\n                        - draft\n                        - open\n                        - closed\n                    type: string\n                title:\n                    minLength: 1\n                    type: string\n                type:\n                    enum:\n                        - bug\n                        - feature\n                        - task\n                    type: string\n            required:\n                - title\n            type: object\n        TrailCreateResponseBody:\n            additionalProperties: false\n            properties:\n                $schema:\n                    description: A URL to the JSON Schema for this object.\n                    examples:\n                        - /api/v1/schemas/TrailCreateResponseBody.json\n                    format: uri\n                    readOnly: true\n                    type: string\n                has_new_branch:\n                    type: boolean\n                trail:\n                    $ref: \"#/components/schemas/TrailWriteJSON\"\n            required:\n                - trail\n                - has_new_branch\n            type: object\n        TrailDetailResponse:\n            additionalProperties: false\n            properties:\n                $schema:\n                    description: A URL to the JSON Schema for this object.\n                    examples:\n                        - /api/v1/schemas/TrailDetailResponse.json\n                    format: uri\n                    readOnly: true","is_error":false}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"d2747ceef21a66ef8c5cde058e515efb01bf996d8fea49a5076fc73b0a1e662c","message":{"role":"system","content":"<total_tokens>14801170 tokens left</total_tokens>"}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"5e4e7778a77dd980d30699f6f40d5870a9e4f3ed8e8a9a192871b24138e3cce1","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"`branch_name` / `branch_action` — **snake_case**, with `additionalProperties: false`. The CLI sent camelCase, so the server rejected it as an unknown property. Same stale-binary class as the finding-404 gotcha."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0179E2mtdW7mtSPP6fFjUNB4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-locus-anchors && echo '{\"title\":\"fix(facts): stop the locus extractor cutting paths at hyphens and dots\",\"body\":\"A fact about website/scripts/pre-build.ts was anchored to two tokens that name nothing: website/scripts/pre and build.ts. One regex, locusIdentifierPattern in internal/cli/facts_locus.go, admitted no hyphen inside a path segment and no leading dot; factLocus add() trimmed punctuation from both ends, so .github/workflows/ci.yml was stored as github/workflows/ci.yml.\\n\\nA fragment is worse than a missing anchor: it looks like a path, binds the fact to a file that does not exist, and escapes factLocusDrift (locusTokenIsFilePath needs both a slash and an extension, and neither fragment has both).\\n\\nSegments are now [A-Za-z0-9_]+(?:-[A-Za-z0-9_]+)* with an optional leading dot. The hyphen must be interior and a . or / is still required, so hyphenated prose stays out of the locus. No migration: reclassify already rewrites Locus when it differs from the text.\\n\\nVerified by weakening three guards; full internal/cli suite green. Reported by ashtom. PR #410.\",\"base\":\"main\",\"branch_name\":\"fix/locus-hyphenated-paths\",\"branch_action\":\"link\",\"type\":\"bug\",\"status\":\"open\"}' | entire api --to cell -X POST -i --input - \"/api/v1/trails/gh/entireio/entire-brain\" 2>&1 | sed -n '1p;12,22p'","description":"Create the trail with snake_case fields"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
