ent's current ETag. A MATCHING If-Match also satisfies the non-empty-document guard on its own — it proves you know the document's current state, so overwrite:true is not needed alongside it. Omit If-Match while leaving overwrite false, and a non-empty document is refused with 409 (carrying its current ETag to retry with) instead.\"\n                    type: string\n            requestBody:\n                content:\n                    application/json:\n                        schema:\n                            $ref: \"#/components/schemas/TrailBodyPutRequestJSON\"\n                required: true\n            responses:\n                \"200\":\n                    content:\n                        application/json:\n                            schema:\n                                $ref: \"#/components/schemas/TrailBodyDocumentJSON\"\n                    description: OK","is_error":false}]}}
