{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"ab12033da00a42f1ee344d5087ac83c91a8680f50e1bdd390aa5464cf822613c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PMjd8U8ARZdZf2XT9AjMJv","name":"mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_issue","input":{"team":"Core","project":"P-COR-39","title":"Ollama envelope test measured the fake server's own cap, not the client bound","priority":3,"state":"In Progress","description":"The ollama envelope guard was load-flaky and failed on `main`, not just on branches.\n\nRoot cause: the test's bound sat *inside* the fake server's own cap, so what it actually measured was scheduling, not the client's envelope limit. Under load the scheduler alone could push it over.\n\nFix: bound the guard by the client, not the writer, so the assertion is about the thing the test names.\n\nTrail: https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/266","links":[{"url":"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/266","title":"Trail 266 — ollama envelope guard"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"4e6580f44c3e8714b333f963634942ddf22697e478dc948554ef283f8ef6113c","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PMjd8U8ARZdZf2XT9AjMJv","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2181\",\"uuid\":\"6099c31e-78fc-4e7e-86ae-0aef9727e4ef\",\"title\":\"Ollama envelope test measured the fake server's own cap, not the client bound\",\"description\":\"The ollama envelope guard was load-flaky and failed on `main`, not just on branches.\\n\\nRoot cause: the test's bound sat *inside* the fake server's own cap, so what it actually measured was scheduling, not the client's envelope limit. Under load the scheduler alone could push it over.\\n\\nFix: bound the guard by the client, not the writer, so the assertion is about the thing the test names.\\n\\nTrail: [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/266](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/266>)\",\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2181/ollama-envelope-test-measured-the-fake-servers-own-cap-not-the-client\",\"gitBranchName\":\"suhaan/cor-2181-ollama-envelope-test-measured-the-fake-servers-own-cap-not\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-19T14:44:29.099Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-19T14:44:29.099Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-19T14:44:29.154Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"05f3eff2-33f3-406f-ac29-3f42464a9fb7\",\"title\":\"Trail 266 — ollama envelope guard\",\"subtitle\":\"Host code and agent sessions together on a fast, distributed Git network. Give your agents the context to understand, collaborate, and ship.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/266\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Suhaan Thayyil\",\"createdById\":\"383d093a-5c76-4a6c-9c2b-660b61ca3f3d\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}]}]}}
