{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"ecd828eafaa29fdf6b37c90fd3af77ea6999d520d976b72ae6784e1f0a2cd387","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FMoCUs1awLz4HsVKnXSGuV","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2029\",\"title\":\"7. cli: hidden `entire repo whereami --json`\",\"status\":\"Done\",\"project\":\"P1 · Shared / Hosted Brain\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2029/7-cli-hidden-entire-repo-whereami-json\",\"description\":\"**Repo:** entireio/cli · **Plan:** [Plan: CLI repo whereami](<https://linear.app/entirehq/document/plan-cli-repo-whereami-cor-2029-0ef50d5d158d>)\\n\\nCompose `gitremote.ResolveRemoteRepo(\\\"origin\\\")` → `resolveForgeRepoCellPlacement` → print `{\\\"repo_id\\\",\\\"api_url\\\",\\\"jurisdiction\\\"}` (region-local ULID, cell apiUrl, slug). Stdout is exactly the JSON; errors to stderr. Consumed by `entire brain connect`.\\n\\n**AC:** tests for gh/ and et/ forks, no-origin error, output purity.\\n\\n---\\n\\n*Ticket 7 of 10; numbering is the dependency order.* *Source of truth: the Linear project documents (spec + plans). Parent:* <issue id=\\\"d4f64ea2-cd3d-43c0-be4c-26700f8d392e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2033/hosted-memory-sync-master-plan-brain-facts-brainstore-teammates\\\">COR-2033</issue>.\\n\\n### Completed — 2026-10-14\\n\\nMerged in <pull-request id=\\\"3556a88b-1d77-4764-a8c7-2e3aa1608ddb\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/entirehq/review/feat-expose-hosted-repo-coordinates-in-repo-view-json-bf3a5a210dbd\\\">entireio/cli#2758</pull-request>.\\n\\nThe shipped interface supersedes the original `whereami` proposal: `entire repo view --json` exposes top-level `repoId` and `apiUrl`, and omitting the repository argument resolves the current repository from origin. GitHub and Entire-native repositories are supported. Unresolved coordinates are omitted together; consumers must require both fields before making a repository-scoped API call.\\n\\nValidation: full `mise run check` (race-enabled unit/integration tests and deterministic canaries), focused regression tests, and lint passed. All five findings on [trail 1555](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/cli/trails/1555/feat-add-api-url-and-repo-id-to-the-repo-view-command>) were resolved.\"}"}]}]}}
