ral \"entire brain connect\":\nhosted_status_test.go and publish_test.go. They now assert through\nbrainInvocation, which is the pattern the rest of this branch's tests already\nuse (dash_test, facts_integrity_test, mcp_missing_brain_note_test). That is the\npoint of the PR: the spelling is the reader's, not a constant.\n\nVerified by weakening: dropping the rendered remedy from hosted_status.go makes\nTestStatusHostedDisconnectedByOptOut fail; restored, green -- so the rewritten\nassertions are not vacuous.\n\nFull internal/cli suite green (0 failing of the whole package), every other\npackage green, go vet ./... clean.\nMSG\ngit push origin HEAD:fix/runnable-remedies 2>&1 | grep -viE \"^remote:|vulnerab|dependabot|^\\[entire\\]\" | tail -2","description":"Commit and push 348"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
