{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"6dcbe53f10fa2909d35bea5aea63c2006f76f804c0a98693cb88590398dadd55","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EzkkKp5CnFbjLxyUL4j1sj","type":"tool_result","content":"=== how does main handle the agents phase?\n849:\tagentsPhase := run.Begin(setupui.PhaseAgents)\n850-\tagentsPhase.Step(\"session-end hook\")\n851-\treport.Hook = inspectSessionEndHook(repoDir)\n852-\thookLine, hookWired := setupHookSummary(report.Hook, rend.Dash())\n853-\n854-\t// The push hook rides this phase for the reason the phase exists: both\n855-\t// hooks are wiring that makes later work reach the brain without anyone\n856-\t// remembering to run anything. It arrived on main as a flat block after\n857-\t// the watcher; it depends on nothing the watcher does, so it belongs\n858-\t// beside the hook it is a sibling of rather than in a row of its own.\n859-\tagentsPhase.Step(\"push hook\")\n860-\tpushDetails := refreshSetupPushHook(ctx, opts, repoDir, brainCmd)\n861-\n862-\tif hookWired {\n863-\t\tagentsPhase.OK(hookLine, pushDetails...)\n864-\t} else {\n865-\t\tagentsPhase.Skip(hookLine, pushDetails...)\n866-\t}\n867-\n868-\t// Phase 4 — FACTS. The only phase that can spend money, and the only one\n869-\t// that asks first.\n870-\tbackfillStarted := time.Now()\n871-\tfactsPhase := run.Begin(setupui.PhaseFacts)","is_error":false}]}}
