{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"0ffecdda4727be88402f706d4a8c132dab26db983631bd4d2359993af5dc6d23","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now closing the gap I found in #342 — its next-step doesn't say *what* `init-agents` writes:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014HyaX2FtUzhTGJa5TEVs6Z","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-b-agentwiring && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path(\"internal/cli/setup_ui.go\"); s = p.read_text()\nold = '''\t\t\tWhy:     \"tell agents this brain exists (nothing will use it until this runs)\",'''\nnew = '''\t\t\tWhy:     \"write AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md so agents can see this brain (nothing will use it until this runs)\",'''\nassert old in s\np.write_text(s.replace(old, new, 1)); print(\"the row now says WHAT it writes\")\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path(\"internal/cli/setup_terse_test.go\"); s = p.read_text()\nold = '''\tif len(unwired) != len(wired)+1 {\n\t\tt.Fatalf(\"init-agents must be added, not substituted: wired=%d unwired=%d\", len(wired), len(unwired))\n\t}'''\nnew = '''\tif len(unwired) != len(wired)+1 {\n\t\tt.Fatalf(\"init-agents must be added, not substituted: wired=%d unwired=%d\", len(wired), len(unwired))\n\t}\n\t// And it must say WHAT it writes, or it reads as one more optional command.\n\t// The reported case was a user who ran setup, found no agent files, and\n\t// concluded they had run it from the wrong directory. They had not.\n\tif !strings.Contains(unwired[0].Why, \"AGENTS.md\") {\n\t\tt.Fatalf(\"the init-agents row does not say what it writes: %q\", unwired[0].Why)\n\t}'''\nassert old in s\np.write_text(s.replace(old, new, 1)); print(\"assertion added (carried over from the test #329 retired)\")\nPY\nenv -u FORCE_COLOR GOMAXPROCS=2 go test ./internal/cli/ -run 'TestNextStepsLeadWithInitAgents' -p 1 -parallel 1 -count=1 2>&1 | tail -2","description":"Carry the says-why claim onto 342","timeout":400000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
