{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"20d867a650c4f6a6fac3a6db5740ee894aeb7e26025cc32db20543ec3a3622eb","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The behavioural tests just revealed something real — and that my replacement modelled the wrong thing:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E1u9BDEeVx6jXyWpSKdCU7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-retrieval && sed -n '335,348p' internal/cli/hook_cmd.go; echo \"=== gate:\"; sed -n '240,250p' internal/cli/hook_cmd.go","description":"Read stdinIsPipe and the gate"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","hash":"f29c4d182d78a4b333954bfe9029e54aa38dfefbd3baa9fa644bdbcfb00ba4e9","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E1u9BDEeVx6jXyWpSKdCU7","type":"tool_result","content":"// stdinIsPipe reports whether stdin carries piped input. A character device is\n// a terminal, and reading one blocks forever — the difference between a hook\n// that no-ops when hand-run and one that hangs the shell.\nfunc stdinIsPipe(r io.Reader) bool {\n\tfile, ok := r.(*os.File)\n\tif !ok {\n\t\t// A test buffer or any other reader: readable without blocking.\n\t\treturn true\n\t}\n\tinfo, err := file.Stat()\n\tif err != nil {\n\t\treturn false\n\t}\n\treturn info.Mode()&os.ModeCharDevice == 0\n=== gate:\n\t\t\t// EOF -- one inherited from a parent that has not closed it -- that\n\t\t\t// read blocks for up to maxClaudeHookEventBytes, which is the\n\t\t\t// hand-run hang the check above this one exists to prevent.\n\t\t\tif strings.TrimSpace(file) == \"\" && stdinIsPipe(cmd.InOrStdin()) {\n\t\t\t\tif path, ok := decodeClaudeHookEventPath(cmd.InOrStdin()); ok {\n\t\t\t\t\tfile = path\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tif strings.TrimSpace(file) == \"\" {\n\t\t\t\t// An event that names no path at all (a Bash call reaching a\n\t\t\t\t// loose matcher, say) is the hook contract's silent-honest-empty","is_error":false}]}}
